==English==
{{wikipedia|sexually transmitted disease}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|sg=[[sexually]] [[transmitted]] [[disease]]|s}} (''Abbreviated'' '''[[STD]]''')

# {{disease}} Any of various diseases that are usually [[contract]]ed through [[sexual contact]].

